      "value": "I like the Unverified tag that would be under the nameplate, would make definitely make it more clear to new players.  I think they should keep the 4 characters after the name for steam/oculus/viveport etc accounts, removing that via merging would be an additional incentive for people to make a normal VRChat account.",
