      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I personally feel unverified accounts should be treated as trial accounts and be given a 14 day limit where users are forced to to verify an account at the end of it.  Honestly this would probably reduce at least a portion of underaged users whose parents may have no idea what VRchat who may not want to register an account outside of oculus for their children.",
